---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Engineering | Steve Weiler"
  description="Engineering notes from Steve Weiler about software, systems architecture, Linux, infrastructure, and AI."
>
  <main>
    <section class="page-header engineering-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">Writing and technical notes</p>
      <h1>Engineering</h1>
      <p>Architecture, project deep dives, benchmarks, and practical software and systems engineering notes.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="article-feature article-feature--vector" aria-labelledby="focalvector-article-title">
      <a class="vector-article-visual" href="/engineering/focalvector-optimization-stack/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="vector-visual-label">Query path</span>
        <div class="vector-visual-stack">
          <span>Exact oracle</span>
          <span>HNSW</span>
          <span>Scalar int8</span>
          <span>AVX2</span>
          <span>CUDA · cuBLAS</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vector-visual-result">
          <strong>0.316 ms</strong>
          <span>100k × 128 · ef 384</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <div class="article-feature-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Performance · FocalVector</p>
        <h2 id="focalvector-article-title">
          <a href="/engineering/focalvector-optimization-stack/">Fast by layers</a>
        </h2>
        <p class="article-deck">
          Quantization, SIMD, deterministic parallel construction, zero-copy
          persistence, and optional CUDA search—without allowing optimization to
          redefine the correct answer.
        </p>
        <div class="article-meta">
          <time datetime="2026-08-02">August 2, 2026</time>
          <span>10 minute read</span>
        </div>
        <a class="article-read-link" href="/engineering/focalvector-optimization-stack/">
          Read the optimization deep dive <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="article-archive" aria-labelledby="more-writing-title">
      <div class="article-archive-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">From the archive</p>
        <h2 id="more-writing-title">More engineering notes</h2>
      </div>
      <article class="article-archive-card">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Architecture · FocalDesk</p>
          <h3><a href="/engineering/focaldesk-frame-loop/">The frame loop is a boundary</a></h3>
          <p>Keeping a Wayland compositor responsive by moving variable-latency work behind explicit, recoverable service boundaries.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="article-meta">
          <time datetime="2026-08-02">August 2, 2026</time>
          <span>7 minute read</span>
        </div>
        <a class="article-read-link" href="/engineering/focaldesk-frame-loop/">Read article <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </article>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
